title: 'pallet-babe: include the partially filled segment in the next epoch randomness'
doc:
- audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
  description: |-
    The next epoch randomness was computed only from completely filled 256-entry segments of VRF
    outputs, so an epoch with fewer than 256 primary blocks contributed nothing. The partially
    filled segment is now included. This changes the epoch randomness of chains using `pallet-babe`.
crates:
- name: pallet-babe
  bump: patch
